<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Feb 8 totalled 133.099 million, versus a revised 136.708 million in the previous week and 133.801 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 172.261 million, versus a revised 170.691 million the previous week and 167.122 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
